{"server":"cn","storyId":"act14side_level_act14side_04_end","groupId":"act14side","stageId":"act14side_04","title":"立雪求道","storyCode":"BI-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"a3f07c4ed5fdfd6fde6c66ae113820482f0f1a437d68ef2cee698723894bedc5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"三大家族的领袖来到圣山广场，参加圣猎的誓师大会。\n对于即将到来的大典，各家都有自己的想法。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，喝口热水吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从昨天开始您就滴水未进，走了这一路，之后还要参加狩猎，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让我说第二次，角峰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再说了，角峰大哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷的脾气你应该最清楚，明知老爷肯定不会接受，又何必这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少我得试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷他......太冒险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风险与机遇并存，一直不都是这么过来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只需要听老爷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真冷。这雪是不是越来越大了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g6_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我们两家一起等着他，好大的排场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一路步行而来，这倒确实不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真稀奇，你竟也会夸他？听说这一路上，恩希欧迪斯是被交口称赞，受欢迎得很啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，你可要小心点，说不定再过几天，耶拉冈德最虔诚的信徒就要从你阿克托斯变成他恩希欧迪斯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风凉话就免了，菈塔托丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我虽不信任恩希欧迪斯，但他若做得对，我便说对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你把我喊过来就是为了说这些，那就恕我不奉陪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没有那么闲，阿克托斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是要提醒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提醒？有什么事是需要你菈塔托丝来提醒我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，逞口舌之快对我们都没有好处。在当下，我们两家之间才是最牢固的盟友关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逞口舌之快的恐怕不是我，菈塔托丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢你和恩希欧迪斯的那种弯弯绕绕，我一向只看行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只看行动，那正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就谈谈两天前的那场爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，难道菈塔托丝你要承认那是你布朗陶家所为？哼，我可不信，这事不是你的风格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你知道主谋是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要是说我知道呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——此话当真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝无虚言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，你要不要猜猜，我们的这位援兵究竟会是什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫希，莫希！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人呢，跑哪儿去了......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人。您找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找没找你，这还用问吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平时你不是挺机灵的，怎么偏偏在这种时候瞎跑！我明明说了这次狩猎一定要好好准备......算了，你准备得怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可实话和你说了，莫希，你是我手下最可靠的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次我能不能给布朗陶家争光，让菈塔托丝那个臭女人没话可说，可全都看你的表现了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，恕我直言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什么想说的就说，别扭扭捏捏的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"属下认为，夫人若是真的有心在这次仪式上有所表现，令菈塔托丝夫人对您刮目相看，只将目光放在狩猎上，或许还有所不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这我也知道......但除此之外还能怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托丝那女人总会把一切都想好，半点空间也不给我留。哼，就算我承认她比我聪明一点点好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也......我也不是个废物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这次不管怎么样，你都一定要给我大出风头，莫希！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们一起压一压菈塔托丝那个臭女人的气焰，我一定要让她好好瞧瞧我的厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白您对布朗陶家的心意，夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，您就更不能只盯着狩猎本身来考虑这次的行动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你说说，我们还能干点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果夫人相信我的判断——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这说的什么废话，我不信你还能信谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的信任，夫人。那么就请将此事交给我吧，我有一些想法......但需要见机行事，目前我还不能妄下结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及夫人，为了行动能够顺利，此事最好也不要对尤卡坦老爷提及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连尤卡坦也不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，那家伙总是当我是个小姑娘一样拦着我做事，还和菈塔托丝告密，别以为我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就全都交给你了，莫希！一定不要让我失望！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，请您放心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫希","speakerId":"avg_npc_255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......届时，属下一定会让您大出风头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g13_mountpath_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“响铃之音来自祂最澄澈的心灵，爱祂的人无不垂首聆听，而耶拉冈德注视着所有虔诚的子民。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——听。整点的铃声刚刚响起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您险些就来迟了，恩希欧迪斯大人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您原谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通向真知的路总不好走，这一定也是耶拉冈德给予希瓦艾什的考验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从图里卡姆出发，步行来到喀兰圣山，确实是辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......希望您真的能够找到正确的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有圣女大人的这句祝福，前路已然明朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如此刻，我正朝耶拉冈德的教诲而去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的口才当真出众，恩希欧迪斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过誉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次竟劳圣女大人亲自接见，诚惶诚恐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯大人摆出如此阵仗，我又怎么敢驳了您的面子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大长老现在何处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大长老在做祭拜的准备，我就出来迎接您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次圣猎，我将遵循耶拉冈德的旨意，与各位共进退，完成这场仪式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......您要亲自进入猎场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，恩希欧迪斯大人也认为我的决定过于轻率吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......绝无此意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是感慨——看来圣女大人已逐渐有了身为三大家族统领者的自觉。这是谢拉格之幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是做我分内之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侍女","speakerId":"avg_npc_269","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人，恩希欧迪斯大人，圣猎即将开始，请尽快移步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......时候是差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请随我来吧，恩希欧迪斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有何吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论您的路是否走对，谢拉格总有它自己的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人能够替所有耶拉冈德的子民做决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您所言......亦正是我所想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"功过是非自有他人评判。事到如今，义理俱成，我断无退却之理。我之所为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不过尽人事罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g6_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德在上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本代圣女在此宣誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将带领谢拉格最优秀的战士，揪出躲藏在群山之中的山雪鬼，将其消灭，为谢拉格带来安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德在上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":fals